  "evidence_rationale": [
    "Sole diagnostic RED uses unpatched actual normal os.close after append/True acknowledgement, validates owned descriptor before close, observes unpatched EBADF at the single diagnostic seam and afterwards, verifies independent-process flock release and valid borrowed root, then fails only exact-origin propagation (4 cases).",
    "Allocation RED delegates to actual os.open and records its real live fd, visits getpid once and preserves exact origin/frame, then fails the no-allocation assertion (2 cases). GREEN proves no owned allocation and no leaf; positive constructor/append/lock control precedes each fault case.",
    "Close-primary OSError/KeyboardInterrupt survives all four secondary nonlocal diagnostics before and after physical release. Constructor first-file-fstat/pread with OSError/KeyboardInterrupt survives secondary close GeneratorExit plus EIO/SystemExit diagnostic, retaining typed snapshot including absent initial identity.",
    "All original 51 cases and existing 6 acknowledgement/16 cleanup regressions are unchanged and pass; original failed reports and old scratch harnesses were not edited or rerun."
  ],
